Z||000016||The Fieromaster||12-23-2001||04:42 AM||||Yea lemme make a list of the BEST vids...<P>"Jun supra monster drift" MUST have video i have never seen such a wicked mad crazy brutal drift!<P>"Crash - Car Accidents - Pizza Guy Gets Hit By A Car" Good video kinda FREAK looks like the guy really gets hit<P>"skyline burnout" wicked AWD doughnuts<P>"Camaros & Trans Ams crazy Burnout" i have NEVER seen more smoke in my life!<P>"corvette-crash" AWESOME from the real tv show... amazing 160mph wreck into a SLOW moving truck!<P>"damn near flying camero" HOLY launch power!  Leavs the line almost on his rear bumper!<P>"rx7 blown motor" watch this jackass do a doughnut and SHOOT the rotor out his hood!!<P>"spitit race gst and spinout" good race video spirt loses it and spins out (in car cam!)<P>"world rally cross video - tunes by linkin park" ABSOLUTLY AWESOME music video!!  AMAZING!!<P>"Walser vs busa" who said a Supra cant smoke the fastest crotch rocket availible??<P>Also... if it says CRASH in the video its good!! I dont keep crappy wreck videos!<P>All the banned comercials are funny!  ESPECIALLY the "chipshot dot com" one its a MUST SEE!!<P>and lastly the "angry....." collection is all zipped up quicktime movies. They are HILARIOUS claymation vids of a boy and his adventurs... the best are "buzzoff, backward, horror, stinkey, swear, and wee wee" those are the BEST and if you have a sence of humor are also must see vids!!<P><BR>****IMPORTANT, please read below**** <BR>i have been doing some name updating on the server SOOOO if the video name sounds like somthing you already have but the file you have is named different... I MAY have changed the name... I am slowly going to chage them all to fit what they are!  So that its less confusing to what your downloading!<BR>I also ask that if you upload... again PLEASE make sure you stick the pics and videos in the correct folders and name them descriptivly so that everyone knows what they are!<P>Please upload your pics and videos though folks.... then everyone can share the great pics and videos of our wonderful cars!!<BR><p>[This message has been edited by The Fieromaster (edited 12-23-2001).]||||reg||1
